    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>Though your Species heals quickly over time, you can push through your pain in the short term and return to fighting form.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wookiee\" title=\"Wookiee\">Wookiee</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever you catch a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Wind\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Second Wind\">Second Wind</a>, you regain an additional number of Hit Points equal to twice your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> bonus (minimum +2).</p>",
